URL: ${$json.url || ''}
Content:
${$json.content || ''}

Relevance Analysis:
Relevance Level: ${$json.relevanceLevel || ''}
Match Score: ${$json.matchScore || 0}
Reason: ${$json.reason || ''}
Matched Problem: ${$json.matchedProblem || ''}

Create a response that:
